        "text": "According to Chief Justice Roberts, chief Justice Roberts announced that argument would be heard first in the morning in Nijhawan v. Holder."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "9e21b2335b17ecd78011cd230ca973f55890f5a7a2fd7db10f90a12c41ce4192",
