            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kennedy asked how often juries give special verdicts and whether that has changed after Apprendi."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "9e21b2335b17ecd78011cd230ca973f55890f5a7a2fd7db10f90a12c41ce4192",
